        "code": {
          "text": "Cough history"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Ongoing for approximately 2 weeks, mainly dry; sometimes a small amount of white sputum in the morning. No blood. Worse at night and on waking; wakes him a few times but he goes back to sleep."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-7",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-7",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Associated respiratory symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies shortness of breath, chest pain, and wheeze. No fever now; felt a bit hot during the first couple of days and is now well."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-8",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Reported potential cough triggers"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Patient thinks cough may be related to dust at work and a musty house with an old heater that smells unpleasant. Clinician considered dust and possible post-nasal drip as contributors."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-9",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Smoking, vaping, medication, and activity history relevant to cough"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Non-smoker; does not vape; not taking an ACE inhibitor. No history of asthma. Still working with no exertional limitation."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-10",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "General appearance and observed cough"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Looks well, talking in full sentences, with an occasional dry cough."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-11",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
